\p
\v 1 Then Shemuel¦130293 said to all Yisrael¦130298, “\add ≈Listen to me now.\add* I've listened¦130300 to your voices¦130301 \add ≈and taken notice of everything\add* that you all said to me. And I've \add ≈appointed\add* a king to reign over you all.
