\v 3 \add and\add* here I am now. \add ≈Now with¦130334 Yahweh¦130336 listening, answer this truthfully\add*: Have I \add ever\add* taken anyone's ox or donkey¦130345? Did I cheat anyone? Have I oppressed¦130351 anyone or taken a bribe \add ≈to not see something\add*? I'll¦130361 pay back anything I owe \add anyone\add*.”
