\v 6 “It was Yahweh¦130403 who appointed¦130405 Mosheh¦130408 and Aharon¦130411,” Shemuel continued¦130398, “and who brought¦130413 your¦130416 ancestors¦130416 out of Egypt¦130418.\x + \xo 12:6: \xt Exo 6:26.\x*
