\p
\v 1 Sha'ul¦130832 was thirty\f + \fr 13:1 \ft TC: There's some confusion around the numbers in this verse in the original manuscripts, so other translations might differ.\f* years old when he \add began to\add* reign over Yisrael¦130839, and \add when\add* he'd reigned for two years,
