\p Sha'ul¦130967 stayed at¦130969 Gilgal¦130969, but¦130959 the people¦130972 with¦130969 him¦130974 were trembling¦130973.
\v 8 He waited¦130976 seven¦130979 days¦130980 until the time¦130981 \add ≈when Shemuel¦130987 had said that¦130982 he'd get there, but¦130976 he didn't¦130984 appear so Sha'ul's men began to desert him\add*.\x + \xo 13:8: \xt 1Sam 10:8.\x*
