\v 15 Then Shemuel \add ≈left\add* Gilgal¦131113 and went to Gibeah¦131114 in Benyamite \add territory\add*. \add ≈Meanwhile,\add* Sha'ul¦131117 counted¦131116 up the \add ≈warriors\add* with him—around six¦131123 hundred¦131124 \add of them\add*.
