\v 17 and¦131140 they sent out three¦131144 \add ≈raiding parties\add*—one went¦131140 \add north\add* to Ofrah¦131152 in the Shu'al region¦131155,
\v 18 one went \add west\add* to Beyt¦131162-Horon¦131163, and¦131164 one went towards¦131174 the wilderness¦131174 where the border¦131168 overlooks¦131169 the Zeboim¦131173 valley¦131172.
