\v 19 \add At¦131191 that time,\add* \add ≈there were no blacksmiths¦131177 in¦131180\add* Yisrael¦131182 because¦131183 the Philistines¦131188 \add ≈didn't¦131178 want the Israelis¦131182 to be able to make¦131190 swords¦131192 or spears¦131194\add*,
