\v 21 (\add ≈They were charged¦131216\add* two-thirds of a shekel¦131217 for \add ≈larger things like plough blades\add*, and one-third for picks and axes¦131222, and for straightening¦131223 \add ox\add* goads¦131224.)
\v 22 \add ≈So¦131226\add* on¦131233 the day¦131227 of battle¦131228, Sha'ul¦131240 and his son Yonatan \add ≈had a sword¦131231 and spear¦131232 each, but¦131226 none of their warriors had any\add*.
