\v 1 Then \add ≈one\add* day¦131259, Sha'uls son Yonatan said¦131260 to the young¦131267 man¦131267 who carried his equipment, “Come on, let's cross¦131271 over to the Philistine unit that's \add ≈over on the opposite side¦131277\add*.” \add ≈But¦131258\add* he didn't¦131280 tell his father¦131279.
