\v 4 \add ≈Meanwhile, for Yonatan to get to the Philistine garrison¦131332, they had to go¦131329 through a narrow pass¦131325 between¦131324 two cliffs\add*. (The cliff on one side was named Botsets, and¦131324 the other¦131343 was named Senneh.
