\p
\v 6 Yonatan said¦131363 to his servant carrying his equipment, “Come on¦131387. Let's pass¦131372 over to that group of these¦131377 uncircumcised¦131376 ones. Perhaps Yahweh¦131380 will \add ≈help\add* us, because¦131382 \add ≈it doesn't matter to him whether he saves\add* using many \add people\add* or \add just\add* a few.”
