\v 10 \add ≈But¦131434\add* if they¦131437 say¦131437, ‘Come on¦131445 up to us,’ then¦131434 we'll go¦131440 up, because¦131441 that'll be the sign¦131449 to us that Yahweh¦131444 \add ≈will help us overpower them\add*.”
