\v 11 \add ≈So¦131451\add* the two of them revealed¦131451 themselves to the Philistine unit, and¦131451 the \add ≈soldiers\add* said¦131457, “\add ≈Hey, look\add*! The Hebrews¦131460 are coming¦131461 out from the holes¦131464 there¦131468 where¦131465 they've hidden¦131466 themselves.”
