\v 13 \add ≈So¦131503\add* Yonatan climbed up on his hands¦131507 and feet¦131510, \add ≈with his servant following\add* behind him. Then¦131503 \add at the top\add*, Yonatan struck them down \add with his sword\add* while his servant \add ≈followed behind and\add* killed them.
