\v 23 \add ≈So¦131688\add* Yahweh¦131689 saved Yisrael¦131694 that day¦131690, and¦131695 the fighting went as far as Beyt-Aven.
\s1 Yonatan eats honey
\rem /s1 Events after the Battle; Saul's Foolish Oath; Jonathan Eats Honey; Saul's Rash Oath
\s4 Full kingdom
\p
\v 24 \add ≈Now\add* the \add ≈Israeli¦131702 warriors¦131702\add* were \add ≈getting exhausted\add* that day¦131706, \add ≈but¦131702\add* Sha'ul¦131709 had made the \add *them\add* promise, “\add ≈We need to avenge¦131723 our\add* enemies¦131724. Anyone who eats food before the evening¦131722 is cursed¦131714.”
